{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Hi, I'm Maspeth! I'm a sweet, cuddly girl with a BIG appetite and a soft spot for my favorite toys. I already know sit and down, and I'm quite the good listener! I'm still getting comfortable in my new surroundings, so I appreciate a little patience and gentle love. I enjoy cozy cuddles, tasty treats, and taking life one day at a time.\n\nI'm having fun discovering my personality, and I can't wait to share more with you. Stay tuned for my pupdates!\n\nThis pet needs emergency placement. Please click here to go to our emergency placement page for more information.\n\nMaspeth is at risk due to behavior concerns. Maspeth in the care center has not been acclimating in the care center despite best efforts to keep her comfortable. Maspeth is jumping at the front of her kennel, hard barking, with visible saliva stains on her neck and her kennel glass door is covered in paw marks and saliva. Maspeth loves going to playgroup and is social with staff but is struggling to acclimate in the care center. Medically, Maspeth is apparently healthy.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=15&searchType=4&animalid=209468","id":"6d6024b4f63c96ba749ed80a6a635dbf","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/47c9e784b2354742966e55f02060aa88-1791940271-1792699178-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/fdd57bd961df474ebbbdf61a2867c5be-1791940272-1791940272-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b34f2b1227114d94b55bafde4254e348-1791940271-1791940271-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d61120410521433ea7a45d5f850fab33-1791940271-1791940271-jpeg/600---n","https